  "question": "Where can I locate attraction within 60 kilometers when heading toward Hyatt Regency Greenwich, Old Greenwich, CT starting at Children's Hospital at Montefiore, Bronx, NY?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-73.878898 40.880372)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-73.567438 41.04722)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE tourism = 'attraction'\nAND ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-73.878898 40.880372)',4326)::geography, 60000)\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-73.878898 40.880372)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5);\n",
